> **Here the rules are prose, not guardrails.** Koa's harness — the Discovery Gate, the
> Architect Guard, the 28-rule linter — runs as *Claude Code hooks*, and this editor does
> not execute them. Nothing below will **block** you: if you break a rule, the error shows
> up at build time, at review, or in production.
>
> To actually verify a change: run `npm run lint:arch` before committing, or open the
> project with Claude Code, where the same criteria do stop the write.

# Architecture Rules

## Template Syntax

| NEVER | ALWAYS |
|---|---|
| `*ngIf`, `*ngFor`, `ngSwitch` | `@if`, `@for`, `@switch` |
| `@Input()`, `@Output()` | `input()`, `output()` |
| `[ngClass]`, `[ngStyle]` | `[class.name]="expr()"`, `[style.prop]="expr()"` |

## Facade Pattern (mandatory)

- UI components (`features/`, `shared/`) **NEVER** inject `SupabaseService`, `HttpClient`, or any data client
- **ALWAYS** use a `*FacadeService` from `core/` — it centralizes state via Signals and exposes data with `toSignal()`
- Facades handle errors with `catchError` and expose an `error = signal<string | null>(null)`

## Change Detection

- `changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on **every** component — no exceptions

## Smart vs Dumb Components

- **Dumb (`shared/`)**: Only `input()` and `output()`. No service injection.
- **Smart (`features/`)**: Inject Facades. Coordinate Dumb components.
- Every async Dumb component has a colocated `{name}-skeleton.component.ts`

## Visual System

| NEVER | ALWAYS |
|---|---|
| `text-red-500`, `bg-blue-200`, `#hex` | `text-primary`, `text-muted`, `bg-canvas`, `bg-surface`, `var(--ds-brand)` |
| emojis as UI icons | `<app-icon name="kebab-case" [size]="16" />` |
| `@angular/animations`, `@keyframes` for views | `GsapAnimationsService` in `ngAfterViewInit` |

## Anti-Patterns — Stop and Fix

| # | Never | Instead |
|---|---|---|
| AP-001 | `[ngClass]="{'active': x}"` | `[class.active]="x()"` |
| AP-002 | `@Input() value` | `input()` |
| AP-003 | `inject(SupabaseService)` in features/shared | Use a `*FacadeService` |
| AP-004 | `text-red-500`, `bg-[#hex]` | Semantic tokens |
| AP-005 | `@angular/animations` import | `GsapAnimationsService` |
